pears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - Lin Wan's facial features, hair, dirty grey cleaner uniform, and forehead band-aid are retained throughout; her uniform becomes progressively wetter as the action develops.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - Zhang Biao's facial features, build, and aggressive demeanor are retained; he holds a full red bucket in Shot 1, hurls the empty bucket in Shot 2, and walks away empty-handed in Shot 3.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - Li Mei's facial features, hairstyle, and business attire are retained; her cold impatient expression remains consistent across all shots.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the corporate building exterior, entrance, wet pavement, puddles, trees, and parked black sedan are retained across all shots with consistent overcast lighting.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a cinematic, realistic live-action style with overcast soft natural lighting and a slightly desaturated, cold color palette.\n\n[Shot 1] A medium-wide shot establishes <Subject 4>, the corporate building exterior with its modern glass facade, entrance area, wet reflective pavement with puddles, and surrounding trees. <Subject 1>, Lin Wan, the young female cleaner in a dirty grey work uniform with a slightly curled adhesive band-aid on her forehead, stands at the center front of the frame. <Subject 2>, Zhang Biao, the aggressive man, stands on the left side of the frame facing her, holding a red plastic water bucket filled with cold water, his face fierce and aggressive. The shot opens directly into the action: <Subject 2> swings the bucket forcefully and hurls the entire bucket of cold water at <Subject 1>. Clear water traces a wide splashing arc through the air. <Subject 1>'s body jolts violently, her shoulders jerk upward as the cold water strikes her face, hair, and uniform, instantly soaking her completely; water droplets hang from her hair and drip down. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed, following the splash. Two security guards stand behind the entrance, their expressions hesitant and reluctant, making no move to intervene. <Subject 3>, Li Mei, the cold elegant woman, stands behind <Subject 2>, her expression cold and impatient, arms slightly crossed. A black business sedan is parked in the distance under the shade of trees. No one speaks throughout the shot.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:06.000, the camera cuts to a medium close-up of <Subject 1>'s drenched face. Water streams down her cheeks and hair, her eyes wide with shock and suppressed humiliation, her breath trembling. <Subject 2>'s hand enters from the left frame and hurls the now-empty red plastic bucket at her feet; it clatters and skids across the wet pavement. The camera tilts down with small amplitude to follow the bucket, then tilts back up as <Subject 3> steps into the left edge of the frame, her high heels clicking on the wet stone. <Subject 3> (S1), the cold elegant woman, looks down at <Subject 1> and says in a sharp, dismissive tone: <d>[Chinese] 扫干净点，别脏了这里的地。</d> <Subject 2> stands beside <Subject 3>, smirking with contempt. <Subject 1>'s lips press tightly together, her fists clenching at her sides, water still dripping from her uniform hem.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:12.000, the camera cuts to a wide shot as <Subject 2> and <Subject 3> turn and walk toward the black business sedan parked in the distance within <Subject 4>. <Subject 3> does not look back; <Subject 2> glances over his shoulder with a sneer. The two security guards exchange a glance but remain at their posts. The camera pulls out with large amplitude at slow speed, gradually revealing the full scale of the imposing glass corporate building looming above <Subject 1>, who stands alone at the center of the wet pavement, completely drenched, water pooling around her feet. Her shoulders slump slightly, then she slowly raises her head and stares at the building entrance with a quiet, resolute expression. The red bucket lies overturned beside her. Distant city traffic moves faintly in the background.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA sudden, loud splash of water cuts through the air, followed by the sharp intake of breath from a startled woman and the heavy rustle of soaked fabric. The empty plastic bucket clatters and skids across wet pavement, while high heels click sharply on stone. Low, tense ambient city noise hums underneath, with distant traffic and a faint wind.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA low, sustained cello drone at a slow tempo, joined by sparse, dissonant piano notes that gradually swell in volume before fading to silence as the camera pulls back.\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "提示词", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}, {"name": "INT", "links": [23, 62], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}, {"name": "BOOL", "links": [], "label": "BOOL", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "BOOL"}], "size": [360, 160], "pos": [91.15120697021484, 738.64013671875], "widgets_values": ["max(5, round(a * 24)) + (5 - (max(5, round(a * 24)) % 17)) % 17"], "inputs": [{"name": "values.a", "link": 20, "label": "values.a", "type": "FLOAT,INT,BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "a"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "values.b", "label": "values.b", "type": "FLOAT,INT,BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "b"}, {"widget": {"name": "expression"}, "name": "expression", "label": "expression", "type": "STRING", "loc